      "writtenOn": "2026-10-18T14:28:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Blocking: `SwitchCLI._command()` waits for `connection.login_prompt` after every command (switch_cli.py:74). JUNOS switches to `#` after `edit`, so every configure/modify times out on `edit`. Reproduced against a fake JUNOS CLI over pexpect; the parent driver succeeds on the same switch. The old driver used `\u003e` only on connect and `#` for command execution. Use `[\u003e#]` as issue #750 proposed, or add a per-command expect. Add a fake-channel test covering edit/commit.",
      "revId": "7ad18c449c3e97c410f79160270d17e179ab7ca0",
