      "message": "Required: `verify_untagged: false` is a workaround for one POC fabric bug, shipped as the global Arista default. It silently disables untagged ping validation for every Arista deployment, and %config(noreplace) keeps it after the fabric fix. Ship true and keep the POC override in the site\u0027s local recipe; log when a recipe disables a validation role.",
