      "writtenOn": "2026-10-18T14:28:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Blocking: the save list runs `write memory` then `copy running-configuration startup-configuration`, with `save_wait: Copy completed` applied only to the last save (switch_cli.py:118-126). The comment says the role denies the copy; EOS prints `% ...` and the prompt, so the expect times out for 120 s and `_set_op` returns False even though `write memory` persisted the change. The EOS spelling is `copy running-config startup-config`, not `...-configuration...`, so an ACL grant would not fix it. Use `save: write memory` with `save_wait: Copy completed` as 1238096 does, or add per-save expects.",
      "revId": "7ad18c449c3e97c410f79160270d17e179ab7ca0",
